Apple today introduced the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/13/apple-homepod-mini-2/">HomePod mini 2</a>, but the full-sized HomePod was not updated. Nevertheless, the alt text for Apple's full-sized HomePod image shown at the bottom of the HomePod order page now <a href="https://x.com/itspdfu/status/2110144473321664771">mentions</a> a "multi-colored Siri AI glow on top," suggesting that the larger HomePod might eventually gain support for Siri AI.<br/>
